{"parse": {"title": "飞渡往日-08", "pageid": 55490, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%9E%E6%B8%A1%E5%BE%80%E6%97%A5-07\" title=\"飞渡往日-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">飞渡往日-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">飞渡往日</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.BC.AB.E6.AD.A51969\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"漫步1969\">漫步1969</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 漫步1969</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Roaming through 1969</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1960108</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>胡安娜——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-513920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-513920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-513920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>门没锁，你自己进来吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士应声进入老朋友的旧宅。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你把电视搬到了二楼吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她环视屋内，处处陈列整齐，屋子打扫得干干净净，却独独不见屋主人所在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>是的，是……天线卡住了，噢，上回迈克尔没修好它，我们就这么扔二楼了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>上来吧，露西，我得折腾折腾这玩意儿，很快，我保证……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>要我帮忙吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>我快弄好了，快了，就是差点儿，有颗螺丝不太听话！坏孩子！你最好老实点……！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chaerdunjia.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chaerdunjia\"><img alt=\"chaerdunjia\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/Cg-chaerdunjia.png/600px-Cg-chaerdunjia.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/Cg-chaerdunjia.png/900px-Cg-chaerdunjia.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/Cg-chaerdunjia.png/1200px-Cg-chaerdunjia.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士坐到一旁，时针指向四点十一分。她几乎能想象到航天基地里的繁忙景象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>他们离月面应该很近了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-513910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-513910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-513910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>是的，很近了，马上就拧紧了……很近了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火花一闪，电线似乎有意不遂人意，以一次小小的爆闪嘲笑设备主人的努力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>很遗憾，它坏掉了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我能修好这东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>行！吧！那吃点东西，我再想想办法。或者，你来想想办法？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>来点玉米糊？葡萄牙的亲戚寄过来的，好吧，我知道这有点怪，但你要来点吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我不需要摄入食物补充能量，胡安娜。不用了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>抱歉抱歉，我差点忘了，你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>偶尔像人类一样吃点东西，或许也不坏？随你吧，哈哈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>蛋白质的能量转化效率比电力和热能低太多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在最近的一个百年里，这是她受益最深的一次革新：将身体改换由伟大的电力驱动，由此得到了数十倍于以往的续航能力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而代价，则是某种近似人性的焦虑悄悄在她纯粹理性的大脑中诞生了——电量焦虑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>也许未来我们可以开发一些更便捷的高能餐食，以节省不必要的用餐时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>好了，吃饭是生活的享受。品尝美食有助于身心健康。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>航天食品是不错的成果，用最小的体积提供了最丰富的营养以维持生存——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>好好好，露西女士，那么你能把这玩意儿折腾好吗？我不想错过直播。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>修好的概率大于百分之九十五，但不保证大于百分之九十八，它有失败的可能……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>我给乔治打了电话，待会儿他会送替换零件来，总之我们先……先让这金属盒子开机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士的手伸向那颗不起眼的小螺丝，殖民时代的老屋中涌出了来自十八世纪的滚滚蒸汽，随着呜呜汽鸣，神秘术的光辉似乎将要唤醒金属造物的意识——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个小概率的意外在白色汽烟中发生了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>咳……咳……嘿，露西，发生什么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308621.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308621.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……我想，可能是神秘术失败了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个指头大小的人型生物站在木地板上。她由铁青色的金属塑成，不比身旁那颗从蒸汽中滚落的活塞核心大上多少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308621.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308621.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>超过四十二个月又十八天没有发生这种状况了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308621.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308621.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308621.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308621.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>真糟糕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>……你以前从没跟我说过会发生这种事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>你看起来就像个模型……还……还蛮可爱的，露西！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>但你……怎么变回来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308621.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308621.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>两分钟或者三分钟，别担心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>嗯……我又认识了一个不太一样的你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308621.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308621.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-308621.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308621.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我只是一枚金属活塞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一枚从启蒙余晖中苏醒的活塞，恰如此时此刻……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>二百年的历史凝滞在这栋老屋中，工程师家族在佛罗里达海岸放下了第一台蒸汽机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>三秒后，机械女士睁开双眼，金属螺丝被胡安娜重新捡起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>我简直想象不到这小东西刚才变成了你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>不稳定的神秘术意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>所以它不能被应用于重要场合，我们不能把成功的筹码压在不可靠的天平上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>修个电视，没问题吧？再来一次，刚才不过是一个小小的意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如她所说。蒸汽再一次从机械活塞中涌出，神秘术的辉光将沉默的显像管唤醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这就好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>信号从三十万公里外传来，黑白画面中，身着厚重宇航服的男人即将走下登陆舱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一种宁静的荒凉随着天外信号传回人类的母星，呈映在金属屏幕里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>那儿很美。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>东方人说月亮上有桂树，还有宫殿和住在宫殿里的公主，公主养着兔子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>荒凉的月球表面不可能生长植物，更不可能饲养家禽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>他们下去了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是小之又小的一步，来自三十万公里外的蓝色行星，将那颗星球上以万年计的无数仰望与幻想化为了脚下的现实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士站在一旁，无声地注视着登月小组在月面漫步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>那时你们只能望着天空叹息，而现在，胡安娜，你们已经把手伸向了无垠的星海。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>胡安娜却转身指向卧室墙上的壁挂油画。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>维克多叔公雇人画了一幅画，喏，就是这个。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_at_haianbianluxi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_at_haianbianluxi\"><img alt=\"1_9_at_haianbianluxi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-1_9_at_haianbianluxi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_at_haianbianluxi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-1_9_at_haianbianluxi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_at_haianbianluxi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-1_9_at_haianbianluxi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_at_haianbianluxi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一幅油画，比这儿的女主人更年长，陪伴胡安娜走过了漫长的军旅生涯与科研岁月。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身负双翼的少女从海港起航，飞过灯塔，飞往太阳，仿佛神话中的代达罗斯之子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>来自我们家族的一位先祖，传说她是第一个飞起来的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一朵遥远的、几乎快被遗忘在岁月长河中的水花。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>1835年我从里斯本起航，在那儿和希梅娜制作了飞行翼的雏形。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>但那时我们只能靠风力来驱动翅膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>最后是神秘术完成了那个遗憾的发明，希梅娜乘着翅膀飞上了开往新大陆的船。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chaerdunjia.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chaerdunjia\"><img alt=\"chaerdunjia\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/Cg-chaerdunjia.png/600px-Cg-chaerdunjia.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/Cg-chaerdunjia.png/900px-Cg-chaerdunjia.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/Cg-chaerdunjia.png/1200px-Cg-chaerdunjia.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>那是你吗，露西？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>七十年后，维克多捡起了这个念头，我们试着使用燃油来提供动力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>但笨重的机械外壳和脆弱的金属管道根本无法支撑长时间飞行，于是他放弃了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>维克多叔公后来成了一位成功的商人，在纽约做橄榄油生意……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>是吗？恭喜他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个成功的商人，一位失败的发明家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>他那时一直在思考飞行翼的商业价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>而对世纪初的科技积累来说，很遗憾，那仍然是个不可能完成的梦想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>对人类有限的寿命来说，未来的确太过遥远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>他们承受不住一百次、一千次乃至上万次的失败，借此来验证一个尚未成熟的项目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>可我们总会有抵达古老而遥远的梦想的那一天。喏，孩子们在天上飞得很开心。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这或许会走很久，这是一条长之又长的路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>十九世纪的人认为飞起来是了不起的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>二十世纪初的人认为能飞得久一些是一项不可能完成的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>在一个半世纪的尺度下，艰难而缓慢地踏步在这条路上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这是一个时间问题，胡安娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>时间推着人们顺流而下，哪怕有人行至半途便不敢迈步向前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哪怕有人在那高山前低头，为近在跟前的面包放弃了远眺高天的梦想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>简单的时间问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>我们总会抵达终点，即便在那之前有无数双翅膀被折断在海风中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>你见证了这一切，露西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我只是在你们身旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>与你们一路同行。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "飞渡往日-08"}}